00:55:43,635 --> 00:55:47,135
寂しい時だけ電話して もううんざりだわ！
Calling only when you're lonely, I'm already sick of it!

613
00:55:47,435 --> 00:55:50,235
孤独と絶望に胸を締め付けられ
My chest is squeezed with loneliness and despair

614
00:55:50,235 --> 00:55:53,635
心が壊れそうになるけれど
My heart feels like it's going to break, but

615
00:55:53,635 --> 00:55:57,135
思い出に残るあなたの笑顔が
Your smiling face remaining in my memories

616
00:55:57,135 --> 00:56:01,135
私をいつも励やしてくれる
Always encourages me

617
00:56:01,235 --> 00:56:05,635
ガラス玉ひとつ 落とされた 追いかけてもうひとつ落っこちた
A single glass bead was dropped; chasing after it, another fell

618
00:56:05,635 --> 00:56:09,635
ひとつ分の陽だまりに ひとつだけ残っている
In a patch of sunlight meant for one, only one remains

619
00:56:09,635 --> 00:56:15,135
心臓が始まった時 嫌でも人は場所を取る
When a heart begins to beat, humans take up space whether they want to or not

620
00:56:15,235 --> 00:56:19,635
ブラックロックシューター 何処へ行ったの？ 聴こえますか？
Black Rock Shooter, where did you go? Can you hear me?

621
00:56:19,635 --> 00:56:23,135
あとどれだけ叫えばいいのだろう あとどれだけ泣けばいいのだろう
How much more do I have to scream? How much more do I have to cry?

622
00:56:23,135 --> 00:56:26,135
もうやめて わたしはもう走れない
Stop already, I can't run anymore

623
00:56:41,635 --> 00:56:45,135
Parade! 輝くんだよ 呼び合う声を 合図に
Parade! It's time to shine, using calling voices as our signal

624
00:56:45,135 --> 00:56:49,635
探しにいく スタートは 何度だって
Going to search, the start is however many times it takes

625
00:56:50,235 --> 00:56:52,635
願い込めて 歌うから
Pouring my wish into song, so

626
00:56:52,635 --> 00:56:55,135
星を撫でて I love you
Stroke the stars, I love you

627
00:56:55,135 --> 00:57:00,635
大空を統べるのは 君と私
Ruling the great sky is you and me

